## Verdict Details

### Verdict Statement

**Status:** {{ verdict | upper }}

{% if verdict == "ALIVE" %}
> All proof gates have been satisfied. The {{ program_name }} program has achieved full closure of required gates and is ready for canonical authorization.
{% elsif verdict == "PARTIAL" %}
> Partial closure achieved. {{ gates_met }}/{{ gates_total }} gates are closed. {{ gates_total - gates_met }} gate(s) remain open with documented remediation path.
{% elsif verdict == "FAILED" %}
> Proof gates not satisfied. {{ failed_gate_count }} gate(s) failed. Root cause analysis required before re-evaluation.
{% endif %}

