## Immutability & Authority

This checkpoint is **permanent and immutable**. The verdict is recorded in the canonical checkpoint ledger and cannot be revoked, rebased, or replaced. Future progress is tracked via new checkpoints, never through revision of prior verdicts.

**Receipt Chain:**
- Prior Checkpoint: `{{ prior_checkpoint_id }}`
- This Checkpoint: `{{ checkpoint_id }}` (`{{ receipt_hash }}`)
- Next Checkpoint: `{{ next_checkpoint_id }}` (pending)

